      "role": "user",
      "content": "yo i keep noticing something weird. like yesterday when the sp500 dipped suddenly around 2pm i actually felt this sharp thud in my chest, almost like a muscle spasm or something. then right after the market bounced back i felt this weird surge of energy. i've had this happen a few times now coincidentally right when the volatility spikes. is there any kind of physiological reason why my body would react to market shifts like that??",
