    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the stress part but it feels way more specific than just being nervous. like, the timing is almost too perfect. it's not just that i'm stressed when the market moves, it's like i feel the move *right before* the candle actually shifts on my screen. like my heart rate hits a certain rhythm and then the volatility happens. do you think there could be some kind of bio-feedback loop going on where my own internal rhythms are actually syncing up with the high-frequency trading cycles?",
